HAMMER RELEASE VERSION 2.0.0

WEBSITE:

hammer.physics.lbl.gov

ABOUT:

Hammer (Helicity Amplitude Module for Matrix Element Reweighting) is a C++ software library, designed to provide fast and efficient reweighting of large Monte Carlo datasets containing semileptonic b-Hadron decays to any desired New Physics, or to any description of the hadronic matrix elements.

Extensive details of the code structure, capabilities, implementation and use, can be found in the Hammer manual at hammer.physics.lbl.gov

